# Bloodthirsty Conqueror only answers an opponent's loss of life: Bot1 bolting their own face loses 3 (20 -> 17) and gains
# nothing, and Bot2 is untouched at 20. Refusal-side partner of ...gains-life-equal-to-damage-dealt-to-an-opponent, where
# the same Bolt at Bot2 gains 3 (the positive control). Bot1's life going back up would show the trigger firing for the
# wrong player.

